  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v11.0.0\n- Add .NET 11.0 target.\n- Drop .NET 8.0 targets (BREAKING)\n- AsyncResult<TModel>. (BREAKING)\n- AccessDenied, ConcurrencyIssue, EntityNotFound, and ServiceUnavailable implement IHttpStatusMessage.\n- Drop [Serializable] attributes. (BREAKING)\n- Add PaymentRequired message.\n- Fix ConcurrencyIssue translations.\n- Fix MidAirCollision translations.\nv2.2.0\n- Add support for ar, de, es, fr, it, ja, ru, zh languages.\nv2.1.0\n- Add EntityNotFound.ForId<TEntity>().\nv2.0.0\n- Add .NET 10.0 target.\n- Drop .NET 9.0 targets. (BREAKING)\nv1.0.0\n- Add .NET 9.0 target.\n- Drop .NET 5.0, NET6.0, NET7.0 targets. (BREAKING)\n- Drop binary serialization on exceptions. (BREAKING)\nv0.3.1\n- Extend ConcurrencyIssue factory method with innerException overload.\nv0.3.0\n- Support .NET 7.0. #62\nv0.2.1\n- Nullable anotations. #48\nv0.1.0\n- Qowaiv.Validation.Abstractions dependency\nv0.0.2\n- AccessDenied (#30)\nv0.0.1\n- AccessDenied (#22)\n- ConcurrencyIssue (#22)\n- EntityNotFound (#22)",
